# ── SG16 AI Engine — build-time configuration ────────────────────────────
# The AI connection is NOT configured here. It is set once on the backend as
# Cloudflare Pages variables (Settings → Variables and Secrets): AI_BASE_URL,
# AI_API_KEY (type Secret), AI_MODEL — plus optional AI_IMAGE_MODEL and
# AI_AUDIO_MODEL. See ARCHITECTURE.md. Never put a key in a VITE_ variable —
# those are compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
#
# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in what you need.

# --- Live web search ------------------------------------------------------
# 1 (default): time-sensitive questions get live news/web context via the
# edge functions (/api/edge/news, /api/edge/search). Set to 0 to disable.
# VITE_SG16_LIVE_SEARCH=1

# --- Local development ----------------------------------------------------
# `npm run dev` serves only the SPA (no /api). For the full stack:
#   npm run build && npx wrangler pages dev dist
# with the AI connection in project/.dev.vars (git-ignored):
#   AI_BASE_URL=https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/<ACCOUNT_ID>/ai/v1
#   AI_API_KEY=<token>
#   AI_MODEL=<model name>
